  "explanation": "I’ll first verify your account/line to check for data-cap limits or roaming settings that can cause slow or dropped mobile data. In parallel, we’ll run a few quick checks on your phone to rule out device settings like Airplane Mode, Data Saver, VPN, or being locked to a slower network. Then I can take the right action (e.g., enable roaming, add data, adjust settings) to restore excellent speeds.",
  "need_verification": {
    "please_provide_one_of": [
      "Phone number on the affected line (preferred)",
      "Customer ID",
      "Full name AND date of birth (YYYY-MM-DD)"
    ]
  },
  "quick_questions": [
    "Are you currently traveling outside your usual coverage area or internationally?",
    "When did the issue start, and is it constant or intermittent?",
    "Does the slowness happen everywhere or only in specific locations?",
    "Are you using a VPN on the phone?",
    "If you switch to Wi‑Fi, do things work normally?"
  ],
  "device_checks": {
    "instructions": [
      {
        "step": "Check status bar",
        "why": "Confirms basic service, network type, and whether data is enabled.",
        "how": "On your phone, check the top status bar and tell me exactly what you see for: signal bars, network type (5G/4G/3G/2G), a data icon, Airplane Mode, Wi‑Fi, Data Saver, and VPN."
      },
      {
        "step": "Run a speed test (cellular only)",
        "why": "Measures current mobile data performance.",
        "how": "Turn off Wi‑Fi temporarily so we test cellular only, then run a speed test and share the result rating if available (very poor/poor/fair/good/excellent) or the numbers (download/upload/ping)."
      }
    ]
  },
  "next_steps_after_you_reply": [
    "I will look up your line to check data usage against your plan’s limit and roaming status.",
    "If you’re roaming and it’s disabled on the line, I will enable roaming at no cost.",
    "If you’ve hit the plan’s data limit, I’ll review options: quick 1–2 GB data refuel (priced per GB by your plan) or a plan change.",
    "If settings are the cause (e.g., Data Saver, VPN, older network mode), I’ll guide you step‑by‑step to fix them."
  ]
}

