      "step": "Verify Preferred Network Mode",
      "how": "Settings > Mobile Network (or Cellular) > Preferred network type",
      "set_to": "5G/4G/LTE (avoid 2G/3G only options)",
      "why": "Older modes can prevent proper registration or cause no service in some areas."
    },
    {
      "step": "Turn Mobile Data ON",
      "how": "In the same Mobile Network settings, ensure Mobile Data is ON",
      "why": "While data being OFF doesn’t cause 'No Signal', we want it ON for a clean network attach once signal returns."
