{
  "thought_process": "I looked up your account and line to rule out carrier-side causes first. Your line 555-123-2002 (L1002) is Active, international roaming is enabled, and you’ve used 8.7 GB out of 15 GB this cycle, so you’re not out of data. Since SMS/calls work and you’re abroad, the most likely causes are on-device: mobile data or data roaming toggled off, Wi‑Fi Calling/VPN/Data Saver interference, network mode set too low, or APN/MMSC misconfiguration. We’ll verify and fix these in order.",
  "account_findings": {
    "customer_id": "C1001",
    "line_id": "L1002",
    "status": "Active",
    "roaming_enabled": true,
    "data_usage_gb": 8.7,
    "data_limit_gb": 15
  },
