      "how_iphone": "Settings > Messages > allow Photos access (and enable MMS Messaging)."
    },
    {
      "title": "Wi‑Fi Calling (just in case)",
      "why": "Sometimes carrier setups for Wi‑Fi Calling interfere with MMS.",
      "do": [
