      "step": "If it still fails: check Messages app permissions",
      "how": [
        "Settings > Apps > Messages > Permissions.",
        "Ensure SMS and Photos and videos (or Storage/Files and media) are Allowed."
      ],
      "why": "Messages needs access to media and SMS to send MMS."
