      "note": "You can turn it back ON after testing if you prefer."
    },
    {
      "title": "Reset APN to default, then reboot",
      "why": "If the MMSC in the APN is missing/incorrect, MMS won’t send. Resetting restores the correct values.",
      "how": [
        "Reset APN settings to default on your phone.",
